    skos:scopeNote "Every assessment objective of SP 800-53A Rev. 5 as carried in the 5.2.0 catalogue, nested as in 800-53A (broader = parent objective; the top objective of each control or enhancement is linked to the 800-53 concept by 'evaluates control'), and the examine, interview and test methods with their assessment objects. Organisation-defined parameters are shown as [organization-defined: label]."@en .

